  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。鼻を抜けるような　辛味が　特徴で脂っこい具材と　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "매운맛이 강한 조미료. 코를 찡하게 만드는 매운맛이 특징으로 느끼한 식재료와 궁합이 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味強勁的調味料。以刺鼻的辣味為特徵。和油膩的食材相當搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très épicé. Sa saveur corsée unique monte facilement au nez. S’accorde bien avec des ingrédients plus gras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Würzmittel besitzt eine sehr prägnante Schärfe, die ein leichtes Stechen im Nasenraum verursacht. Es harmoniert gut mit fettigen Belägen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El fuerte picante de este ingrediente despeja hasta la nariz, por lo que casa especialmente bien con alimentos con alto contenido graso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto piccante. Il suo caratteristico sapore pungente, che si sente fin nel naso, si abbina bene con gli ingredienti grassi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very spicy condiment. Its distinctive sharp sizzle in your sinuses makes it a good match for rich fillings.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。鼻を抜けるような　辛味が　特徴で脂っこい具材と　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
